d><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">↙</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">↙</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>As a result, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"99\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>gcd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Solving for the remainders (the rightmost terms) in the equations above, we get</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"100\" style=\"font-s